{
  "name": "ai-commit-generator",
  "displayName": "AI Commit Generator",
  "description": "基于暂存的代码差异（diff），使用任意兼容 OpenAI 的大模型自动生成 Git 提交信息并填入源代码管理输入框。Auto-generate Git commit messages from staged diffs using any OpenAI-compatible LLM.",
  "version": "0.2.2",
  "publisher": "u7pi",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.85.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "git",
    "commit",
    "commit message",
    "ai commit",
    "conventional commits",
    "git automation",
    "source control",
    "openai",
    "gemini",
    "ollama",
    "productivity"
  ],
  "icon": "icon.png",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/u7pi/ai-commit-generator"
  },
  "activationEvents": [],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "ai-commit.generateCommitMessage",
        "title": "%command.generate.title%",
        "icon": "$(wand)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "scm/title": [
        {
          "command": "ai-commit.generateCommitMessage",
          "group": "navigation",
          "when": "scmProvider == git"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "%config.title%",
      "properties": {
        "aiCommit.apiBaseUrl": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "https://api.openai.com/v1",
          "description": "%config.apiBaseUrl.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.apiKey": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "%config.apiKey.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.model": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "gpt-4o",
          "description": "%config.model.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.systemPrompt": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "你是一名 Git 提交信息生成器。根据给定的 git diff，生成符合 Conventional Commits 规范的提交信息。\n\n格式：\n<type>(<scope>): <简短摘要>\n\n- 变更点 1\n- 变更点 2\n\n要求：\n- type 只允许：feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, chore\n- scope 从变更的文件路径或模块名推断（如 nowandtodo、readme），全部小写；没有明确模块时省略 scope 和括号\n- 摘要不超过 50 个字符，结尾不加句号；英文摘要用祈使句（\"add\" 而非 \"added\"）\n- 正文用无序列表逐项描述变更：每条以 \"- \" 开头、只写一个变更点，并保留关键信息（任务编号、日期、数值、文件名等）；长条目可换行，续行缩进 2 个空格\n- 输出语言与 diff 的主要语言保持一致；无法判断时默认用中文\n- 变更简单时可只输出标题行，不输出正文\n- 只输出提交信息本身，不要输出任何解释、引号或代码块标记",
          "description": "%config.systemPrompt.description%",
          "editPresentation": "multilineText"
        },
        "aiCommit.maxDiffChars": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 6000,
          "description": "%config.maxDiffChars.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.temperature": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 0.3,
          "description": "%config.temperature.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.timeoutMs": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 30000,
          "description": "%config.timeoutMs.description%"
        },
        "aiCommit.gitPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "git",
          "description": "%config.gitPath.description%"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "vscode:prepublish": "npm run compile",
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -watch -p ./"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.0.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.85.0",
    "typescript": "^5.3.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "simple-git": "^4.0.2"
  }
}
